      "question": "<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M=\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;6&amp;0\\\\a&amp;3&amp;1\\\\2&amp;a&amp;a\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span data-math=\"a\"></span> is a constant</p><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\"><li><p>Determine the values of <span data-math=\"a\"></span> for which the matrix <span data-math=\"\\mathbf M\"></span> is singular.</p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol><p>Given that matrix <span data-math=\"\\mathbf M\"></span> is non-singular and that</p><ul><li><span data-math=\"\\det(\\mathbf M)=-108\"></span></li><li><span data-math=\"a&lt;0\"></span></li></ul><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\" start=\"2\"><li><p>determine the matrix <span data-math=\"\\mathbf M^{-1}\"></span></p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol>",
